    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5590" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bō^tryītis</span></b> ,
			ĭdis, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοτρυῗτις</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοτρυώδης</span> (cluster-shaped), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a kind of calamine</i>, <i><span class="en">Cels. 6,
			6</span></i>, n. 6; <i><span class="en">Plin. 34, 10, 22, § 101</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Scrib. Comp. 24</span></i> and
			220.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A precious stone in the form of a cluster of
			grapes</i>, otherwise unknown, <i><span class="en">Plin. 37,
				10, 55, § 150</span></i>.</div>
